  "content": {
    "_uid": "6d363482-2c26-742c-6773-60315462ef0b",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "aaeea469-05fc-e878-a9bc-948a1bc6d9f9",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Professor Marleen Temmerman, Chair, Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology and Director of Women's Health, Faculty of Health Sciences in East Africa, spoke about the causes of maternal and child mortality and the interventions being put in place to reduce deaths.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In an interview with a local television channel, on the sidelines of the conference, Dr Zulfiqar Bhutta, Director, Centre of Excellence in Women and Child Health, AKU, spoke about the role that communities play in securing mother and child health, and explained the importance of traditional health practices in improving health outcomes.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
