    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Centre of Excellence in Women and Child Health and the Canadian Coalition for Global Child Health organised a conference in Nairobi from December 3-5, 2015, to discuss strategies aimed at reducing maternal and child deaths in East Africa in light of the recently adopted Sustainable Development Goals.",
